XM_ex_3 n_ex_16 A n_ex_5 VSS NMOS L=1u W=13u AS=36.4p AD=36.4p PS=31.6u PD=31.6u
* device instance $4 r0 *1 35,16 NMOS
XM_ex_4 VSS B n_ex_16 VSS NMOS L=1u W=13u AS=36.4p AD=36.4p PS=31.6u PD=31.6u
